description: Kaban project rules
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` and `docs/guidance/modern-web.md` before any change.

Hard rules most often broken:
1. Money is integer centavos with `parseMoney` / `formatMoney` only — never `parseFloat`.
2. No hex colors, `px` font sizes, `outline: none`, `@import`, or `*` selectors outside `tokens.css`.
3. `engine/` must not import React, storage, sync, UI, features, app, or DOM globals.
4. No `innerHTML` / `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`; render untrusted text as text.
5. Do not edit anything under `docs/`.
